      "end_timestamp": "01:12",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mm, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day. I've also had a sore tongue, since last weekend. I've had low mood too, for three weeks. Actually, and there's tiredness as well, ten days now.",
